From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zach Taylor <zctaylor.work@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:19:52 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 06/30] atelet: pull non-GCP images with the Docker config

Without --image-credential-provider-config, atelet pulled every image
anonymously, so a private actor image on a registry the node has no
credential provider for could never start. Fall back to go-containerregistry's
DefaultKeychain, which reads $DOCKER_CONFIG/config.json and stays anonymous
for a registry the file does not list.

Fork-Topic: image-pull-keychain
Fork-Upstream: candidate
---
